          "content": "The measures taken by the Ulbricht regime, supported by the Soviet Union, have created a state of nearly total isolation for the citizens of East Berlin... Inaction and mere defensive posture could evoke a crisis of confidence among West Berliners in the Western protective powers. Berlin expects more than words; it expects political action.",
