          "viewing_task": "[01:20] Causation: How did the May 1960 U-2 spy plane incident and the June 1961 Vienna Summit escalate tensions over Berlin?\n[03:35] Consequences: Why did the Berlin Wall paradoxically reduce the risk of nuclear war while handing the USA a propaganda victory?",
