          "image_alt": "Black-and-white archival photograph taken on 21 February 1969 showing Czechoslovak politician Gustáv Husák seated in profile in a dark suit examining an official presentation volume",
          "caption": "Hardliner Gustáv Husák photographed in February 1969, two months before Moscow installed him to enforce twenty years of rigid \"normalisation\" and StB purges across Czechoslovakia."
