          "letter": "E",
          "title": "Source E: Mikhail Gorbachev’s Televised Resignation Address from the Kremlin (25 December 1991)",
          "text": "Due to the situation which has evolved as a result of the formation of the Commonwealth of Independent States, I hereby discontinue my activities at the post of President of the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics... The old system collapsed before the new one had time to begin working, and the crisis in our society became even more acute... Nevertheless, an end has been put to the Cold War and to the arms race, as well as to the mad militarisation of our country, which deformed our economy and public attitudes.",
          "content": "Due to the situation which has evolved as a result of the formation of the Commonwealth of Independent States, I hereby discontinue my activities at the post of President of the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics... The old system collapsed before the new one had time to begin working, and the crisis in our society became even more acute... Nevertheless, an end has been put to the Cold War and to the arms race, as well as to the mad militarisation of our country, which deformed our economy and public attitudes.",
